7278	expected_date	\N	sale.order	\N	\N	\N	547	Expected Date	Delivery date you can promise to the customer, computed from the minimum lead time of the order lines in case of Service products. In case of shipping, the shipping policy of the order will be taken into account to either use the minimum or maximum lead time of the order lines.	datetime	f	\N	\N	f	t	f	f	\N	base	\N	\N	\N	f	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	f	\N	\N	1	2025-08-28 11:33:38.621207	\N
