_date_widget" width="20px"/>\n                </xpath>\n            </data>	sale_stock/views/sale_order_views.xml	\N	\N	1175	\N	extension	t	1	2025-08-28 11:33:38.621207	1	2025-08-28 11:33:38.621207	f
