      </div>\n                    <div class="row">\n                        <div class="col-3">Alamat</div>\n                        <div class="col-6">: <t t-esc="o['partner_id']['street']"/></div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class="row">\n                        <div class="col-3">Tanggal Pemeriksaan</div>\n                        <div class="col-6">: <t t-esc="o.to_date_string(data['registration_date'])"/> <t t-esc="o.to_time_string(data['registration_date'])"/></div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <table class="table table-bordered table-sm mt-5 mb-2">\n                  <tr class="text-center">\n                      <th>Pemeriksaan</th>\n                      <th>Hasil</th>\n                      <th>Nilai Rujukan</th>\n                  </tr>\n                  <tr>\n                      <td><t t-esc="data['examination_type']"/></td>\n                      <td rowspan="2" width="130" class="text-center">\n                        <strong>\n                          <t t-if="data['result'] == 'Positive'">\n                            <span style="color:red">\n                               Positif\n                            </span>\n                          </t>\n                          <t t-if="data['result'] == 'Negative'">\n                            <span>\n                               Negatif\n                            </span>\n                          </t>\n                        </strong>\n                      </td>\n                      <td rowspan="2" class="text-center">Negatif</td>\n                  </tr>\n                </table>\n                <p class="mt-3">Hasil diatas hanya menggambarkan kondisi saat dilakukan pengambilan spesimen. Surat keterangan ini dibuat sesuai dengan kondisi pada saat pengambilan spesimen untuk dipergunakan sebagaimana mestinya.</p><br/>\n                <p>Catatan:</p>\n                <ul>\n                    <li>Jika timbul gejala klinis, atau ada kontak / kecurigaan kontak dengan pasien terinfeksi setelah pemeriksaan dilakukan. Mohon segera lakukan konsultasi dengan Dokter/ fasilitas kesehatan terdekat.</li>\n                    <li>Pemeriksaan ulang dan pemeriksaan tambahan dapat dilakukan kembali berdasarkan rekomendasi Dokter.</li>\n                    <li>Hasil positif dilanjutkan dengan pemeriksaan MT-PCR(swab test) untuk menegakkan diagnosis pasti.</li>\n                </ul>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class="row pt-5">\n                <div class="col-8"/>\n                <div class="col-4">\n                    <p class="mb-0"><t t-esc="o['operating_unit_id']['company_id']['city']"/>, <t t-esc="o.to_date_string(data['registration_date'])"/></p>\n                    <img t-att-src="o['qr_code_url']" style="width:125px;height:125px;"/>\n                    <p class="mb-0 mt-2"><strong><t t-esc="data['practitioner']"/></strong></p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </t>\n      </t>\n    	ehealth_document/report/template_covid_report/report_default_antigen.xml	\N	\N	\N	\N	primary	t	1	2025-08-28 11:34:01.364376	1	2025-08-28 11:34:01.364376	f
476	product.template.product.form	product.template	\N	8	form	<?xml version="1.0"?>\n<data><xpath expr="//form" position="attributes">\n                <attribute name="name">Product Template</attribute>\n            </xpath>\n            <field name="categ_id" position="after">\n                <field name="default_code" attrs="{'invisible': [('product_variant_count', '&gt;', 1)]}"/>\n                <field name="barcode" attrs="{'invisible': [('product_variant_count', '&gt;', 1)]}"/>\n            </field>\n\n            <div name="button_box" position="inside">\n                <button name="145" type="action" icon="fa-sitemap" class="oe_stat_button" attrs="{'invisible': [('product_variant_count', '&lt;=', 1)]}" groups="product.group_product_variant">\n                    <field string="Variants" name="product_variant_count" widget="statinfo"/>\n                </button>\n            </div>\n\n            <xpath expr="//page[@name='general_information']" position="after">\n                <page name="variants" string="Variants" groups="product.group_product_variant">\n                    <field name="attribute_line_ids" widget="one2many" context="{'show_attribute': False}">\n                        <tree string="Variants" editable="bottom">\n                            <field name="attribute_id" attrs="{'readonly': [('id', '!=', False)]}"/>\n                            <field name="value_ids" widget="many2many_tags" options="{'no_create_edit': True}" context="{'default_attribute_id': attribute_id, 'show_attribute': False}"/>\n                        </tree>\n                    </field>\n                        <p class="oe_grey oe_edit_only">\n                        <strong>Warning</strong>: adding or deleting attributes\n                        will delete and recreate existing variants and lead\n                        to the loss of their possible customizations.\n                    </p>\n                </page>\n            </xpath>\n        </data>	product/views/product_template_views.xml	\N	\N	456	\N	primary	t	1	2025-08-28 11:32:18.663929	1	2025-08-28 11:32:18.663929	\N
