1491	report_default_pcr	\N	ehealth_document.report_default_pcr	16	qweb	<?xml version="1.0"?>\n<t t-name="ehealth_document.report_default_pcr">\n        <t t-set="company" t-value="res_company"/>\n        <t t-call="web.external_layout">\n          <t t-set="o" t-value="o.with_context(lang=lang)"/> \n          <div class="page">\n            <div class="row">\n              <div class="col-md-12">\n                <p class="text-center mt-3"><strong>SURAT KETERANGAN HASIL PEMERIKSAAN SWAB PCR</strong></p>\n                <p class="mt-4">Yang bertanda tangan di bawah ini menerangkan bahwa:</p>\n                <div class="mt-3">\n                    <div class="row">\n                        <div class="col-3">No</div>\n                        <div class="col-3">: <t t-esc="o['name']"/></div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class="row">\n                        <div class="col-3">\n                          <t t-if="o['partner_id']['identity_type'] == 'ktp'">NIK</t>\n                          <t t-if="o['partner_id']['identity_type'] == 'sim'">No. SIM</t>\n                          <t t-if="o['partner_id']['identity_type'] == 'paspor'">No. Paspor</t>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class="col-6">: \n                          <t t-if="o['partner_id']['identity_type'] == 'ktp'"><t t-esc="o['partner_id']['nik']"/></t>\n                          <t t-else=""><t t-esc="o['partner_id']['identity_number']"/></t>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class="row">\n                        <div class="col-3">Nama</div>\n                        <div class="col-6">: <t t-esc="o['partner_id']['name']"/></div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class="row">\n                        <div class="col-3">Jenis Kelamin</div>\n                        <div class="col-6">: \n                          <t t-if="o['partner_id']['gender'] == 'male'">Laki-Laki</t>\n                          <t t-else="">Perempuan</t>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class="row">\n                        <div class="col-3">Tanggal Lahir</div>\n                        <div class="col-6">: <t t-esc="o['partner_id']['birthDate'].strftime('%d-%m-%Y')"/></div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class="row">\n                        <div class="col-3">Alamat</div>\n                        <div class="col-6">: <t t-esc="o['partner_id']['street']"/></div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class="row">\n                        <div class="col-3">Tanggal Pemeriksaan</div>\n                        <div class="col-6">: <t t-esc="o.to_date_string(data['registration_date'])"/></div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class="row">\n                        <div class="col-3">Waktu</div>\n                        <div class="col-6">: <t t-esc="o.to_time_string(data['registration_date'])"/> WIB</div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <table class="table table-bordered table-sm mt-5 mb-2">\n                  <tr class="text-center">\n                      <th>Pemeriksaan</th>\n                      <th>Hasil</th>\n                      <th>Nilai CT Value</th>\n                  </tr>\n                  <tr>\n                      <td class="text-center"><t t-esc="data['examination_type']"/></td>\n                      <td rowspan="2" width="130" class="text-center">\n                        <strong>\n                          <t t-if="data['result'] == 'Positive'">\n                            <span style="color:red">\n                               POSITIF\n                            </span>\n                          </t>\n                          <t t-if="data['result'] == 'Negative'">\n                            <span>\n                               NEGATIF\n                            </span>\n                          </t>\n                        </strong>\n                      </td>\n                      <td class="text-center">\n                        <t t-if="data['result'] == 'Positive'">\n                          <span>ORF SARS-Cov-2: <t t-esc="data['orf1ab']"/><br/>N SARS-Cov-2: <t t-esc="data['gen_n']"/></span>\n                        </t>\n                        <t t-if="data['result'] == 'Negative'">\n                          <span>\n                            <strong>SARS-Cov-2 TIDAK TERDETEKSI</strong>\n                          </span>\n                        </t>\n                      </td>\n                  </tr>\n                </table>\n                <p class="mt-3">Hasil diatas hanya menggambarkan kondisi saat dilakukan pengambilan spesimen. Surat keterangan ini dibuat sesuai dengan kondisi pada saat pengambilan spesimen untuk dipergunakan sebagaimana mestinya.</p><br/>\n                <p>Catatan:</p>\n                <ul>\n                    <li>Jika timbul gejala klinis, atau ada kontak / kecurigaan kontak dengan pasien terinfeksi setelah pemeriksaan dilakukan. Mohon segera lakukan konsultasi dengan Dokter/ fasilitas kesehatan terdekat.</li>\n                    <li>Pemeriksaan ulang dan pemeriksaan tambahan dapat dilakukan kembali berdasarkan rekomendasi Dokter.</li>\n                </ul>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class="row pt-5">\n                <div class="col-8"/>\n                <div class="col-4">\n                    <p class="mb-0"><t t-esc="o['operating_unit_id']['company_id']['city']"/>, <t t-esc="o.to_date_string(data['registration_date'])"/></p>\n                    <img t-att-src="o['qr_code_url']" style="width:125px;height:125px;"/>\n                    <p class="mb-0 mt-2"><strong><t t-esc="data['sender']"/></strong></p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </t>\n      </t>\n    	ehealth_document/report/template_covid_report/report_default_pcr.xml	\N	\N	\N	\N	primary	t	1	2025-08-28 11:34:01.364376	1	2025-08-28 11:34:01.364376	f
1492	report_dng_pcr	\N	ehealth_document.report_dng_pcr	16	qweb	<?xml version="1.0"?>\n<t t-name="ehealth_document.report_dng_pcr">\n        <t t-set="company" t-value="res_company"/>\n        <t t-call="ehealth_document.header_dng_document">\n          <div class="page">\n            <div class="row">\n              <div class="col-md-12">\n                <div style="font-size:14px; padding-top:40px;">\n                    <div class="row">\n                        <div class="col-3">Pemeriksa/Investigator</div>\n                        <div class="col-3">: <t t-esc="data['sender']"/></div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class="row">\n                        <div class="col-3">Dokter/Doctor</div>\n                        <div class="col-3">: dr. Amalia Grahani Prasetyo</div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class="row">\n                        <div class="col-3">No. Reg/Reg. No</div>\n                        <div class="col-3">: <t t-esc="o['name']"/></div>\n                    </div>\n                    <br/>\n                    <div class="row">\n                        <div class="col-3">Nama/Name</div>\n                        <div class="col-3">: <t t-esc="o['partner_id']['name']"/></div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class="row">\n                        <div class="col-3">\n                          <t t-if="o['partner_id']['identity_type'] == 'ktp'">NIK/ID No.</t>\n                          <t t-if="o['partner_id']['identity_type'] == 'sim'">No. SIM</t>\n                          <t t-if="o['partner_id']['identity_type'] == 'paspor'">No. Paspor</t>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class="col-3">: \n                          <t t-if="o['partner_id']['identity_type'] == 'ktp'"><t t-esc="o['partner_id']['nik']"/></t>\n                          <t t-else=""><t t-esc="o['partner_id']['identity_number']"/></t>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class="col-3">Kewarganegaraan/Nationality</div>\n                        <div class="col-3">: Indonesia</div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class="row">\n                        <div class="col-3">Tanggal Lahir/DOB</div>\n                        <div class="col-3">: <t t-esc="o['partner_id']['birthDate'].strftime('%d-%m-%Y')"/></div>\n                        <div class="col-3">No. Passport/Passport No.</div>\n                        <div class="col-3">: -</div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class="row">\n                        <div class="col-3">Jenis Kelamin/Sex</div>\n                        <div class="col-3">: \n                          <t t-if="o['partner_id']['gender'] == 'male'">Laki-Laki</t>\n                          <t t-else="">Perempuan</t>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class="col-3">Faskes Asal / Health Facility</div>\n                        <div class="col-3">: DNG Beauty Secrets</div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class="row">\n                        <div class="col-3 pr-0">Waktu Sampling / Collect. Date</div>\n                        <div class="col-3">: <t t-esc="o.to_date_string(data['registration_date'])"/></div>\n                        <div class="col-3">Kota / City</div>\n                        <div class="col-3">: Badung, Bali</div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class="row">\n                        <div class="col-3">Waktu Periksa / Check Date</div>\n                        <div class="col-3">: <t t-esc="o.to_date_string(data['registration_date'])"/></div>\n                        <div class="col-3">Instansi / Institution</div>\n                        <div class="col-3">: General</div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class="row">\n                        <div class="col-3">Waktu Selesai / Result Date</div>\n                        <div class="col-3">: <t t-esc="o.to_date_string(data['registration_date'])"/></div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <table class="table table-bordered table-sm mt-4 mb-2">\n                  <tr class="text-center">\n                      <th>Pemeriksaan/Test</th>\n                      <th>Hasil/Result</th>\n                      <th>Batas Normal / Normal Range</th>\n                      <th>Metode / Method</th>\n                  </tr>\n                  <tr>\n                    <td class="text-center"><t t-esc="data['examination_type']"/></td>\n                    <td class="text-center">\n                      <t t-if="data['result'] == 'Positive'">POSITIVE</t>\n                      <t t-if="data['result'] == 'Negative'">NEGATIVE</t>\n                    </td>\n                    <td class="text-center">\n                      <t t-if="data['result'] == 'Positive'">POSITIVE</t>\n                      <t t-if="data['result'] == 'Negative'">NEGATIVE</t>\n                    </td>\n                    <td class="text-center"><t t-esc="data['examination_type']"/></td>\n                  </tr>\n                  <tr>\n                    <td><strong>Interpretasi</strong></td>\n                    <td colspan="3">Result PCR : <strong><t t-esc="data['result']"/></strong></td>\n                  </tr>\n                  <tr>\n                    <td><strong>Rekomendasi</strong></td>\n                    <td colspan="3"/>\n                  </tr>\n\n                </table>\n                <p class="mt-3 mb-0"><strong>Disclaimer</strong></p>\n                <p class="mb-0"><strong>Catatan:</strong></p>\n                <ul>\n                    <li>Hasil negatif tidak menyingkirkan kemungkinan infeksi SARS-CoV-2, sehingga masih beresiko menularkan kepada orang lain.</li>\n                    <li>Hasil negatif dapat terjadi pada kondisi kuantitas antigen pada specimen di bawah level deteksi alat</li>\n                </ul>\n                <br/>\n                <p class="mb-0"><strong>Note:</strong></p>\n                <ul>\n                    <li>Negative result does not rule out the possibility of SARS-CoV-2 infection, so it is still at risk of transmitting to others.</li>\n                    <li>Negative result can occur in antigen quality condition in specimen below the detection level of the device.</li>\n                </ul>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class="row pt-4">\n                <div class="col-7"/>\n                <div class="col-5">\n                    <p class="mb-0">Badung, <t t-esc="o.to_date_string(data['registration_date'])"/></p>\n                    <p class="mb-0">Dokter Pemeriksa / Physician Examiner</p>\n                    <img t-att-src="o['qr_code_url']" style="width:125px;height:125px;"/>\n                    <p class="mb-0 mt-2"><strong><t t-esc="data['sender']"/></strong></p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </t>\n      </t>\n    	ehealth_document/report/template_covid_report/report_dng_pcr.xml	\N	\N	\N	\N	primary	t	1	2025-08-28 11:34:01.364376	1	2025-08-28 11:34:01.364376	f
1493	report_dng_antigen	\N	ehealth_document.report_dng_antigen	16	qweb	<?xml version="1.0"?>\n<t t-name="ehealth_document.report_dng_antigen">\n        <t t-set="company" t-value="res_company"/>\n        <t t-call="ehealth_document.header_dng_document">\n          <div class="page">\n            <div class="row">\n              <div class="col-md-12">\n                <div style="font-size:14px; padding-top:40px;">\n                    <div class="row">\n                        <div class="col-3">Pemeriksa/Investigator</div>\n                        <div class="col-3">: <t t-esc="data['practitioner']"/></div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class="row">\n                        <div class="col-3">Dokter/Doctor</div>\n                        <div class="col-3">: dr. Amalia Grahani Prasetyo</div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class="row">\n                        <div class="col-3">No. Reg/Reg. No</div>\n                        <div class="col-3">: <t t-esc="o['name']"/></div>\n                    </div>\n                    <br/>\n                    <div class="row">\n                        <div class="col-3">Nama/Name</div>\n                        <div class="col-3">: <t t-esc="o['partner_id']['name']"/></div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class="row">\n                        <div class="col-3">\n                          <t t-if="o['partner_id']['identity_type'] == 'ktp'">NIK/ID No.</t>\n                          <t t-if="o['partner_id']['identity_type'] == 'sim'">No. SIM</t>\n                          <t t-if="o['partner_id']['identity_type'] == 'paspor'">No. Paspor</t>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class="col-3">: \n                          <t t-if="o['partner_id']['identity_type'] == 'ktp'"><t t-esc="o['partner_id']['nik']"/></t>\n                          <t t-else=""><t t-esc="o['partner_id']['identity_number']"/></t>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class="col-3">Kewarganegaraan/Nationality</div>\n                        <div class="col-3">: Indonesia</div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class="row">\n                        <div class="col-3">Tanggal Lahir/DOB</div>\n                        <div class="col-3">: <t t-esc="o['partner_id']['birthDate'].strftime('%d-%m-%Y')"/></div>\n                        <div class="col-3">No. Passport/Passport No.</div>\n                        <div class="col-3">: -</div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class="row">\n                        <div class="col-3">Jenis Kelamin/Sex</div>\n                        <div class="col-3">: \n                          <t t-if="o['partner_id']['gender'] == 'male'">Laki-Laki</t>\n                          <t t-else="">Perempuan</t>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class="col-3">Faskes Asal / Health Facility</div>\n                        <div class="col-3">: DNG Beauty Secrets</div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class="row">\n                        <div class="col-3 pr-0">Waktu Sampling / Collect. Date</div>\n                        <div class="col-3">: <t t-esc="o.to_date_string(data['registration_date'])"/></div>\n                        <div class="col-3">Kota / City</div>\n                        <div class="col-3">: Badung, Bali</div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class="row">\n                        <div class="col-3">Waktu Periksa / Check Date</div>\n                        <div class="col-3">: <t t-esc="o.to_date_string(data['registration_date'])"/></div>\n                        <div class="col-3">Instansi / Institution</div>\n                        <div class="col-3">: General</div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class="row">\n                        <div class="col-3">Waktu Selesai / Result Date</div>\n                        <div class="col-3">: <t t-esc="o.to_date_string(data['registration_date'])"/></div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <table class="table table-bordered table-sm mt-4 mb-2">\n                  <tr class="text-center">\n                      <th>Pemeriksaan/Test</th>\n                      <th>Hasil/Result</th>\n                      <th>Batas Normal / Normal Range</th>\n                      <th>Metode / Method</th>\n                  </tr>\n                  <tr>\n                    <td class="text-center"><t t-esc="data['examination_type']"/></td>\n                    <td class="text-center">\n                      <t t-if="data['result'] == 'Positive'">POSITIVE</t>\n                      <t t-if="data['result'] == 'Negative'">NEGATIVE</t>\n                    </td>\n                    <td class="text-center">\n                      <t t-if="data['result'] == 'Positive'">POSITIVE</t>\n                      <t t-if="data['result'] == 'Negative'">NEGATIVE</t>\n                    </td>\n                    <td class="text-center"><t t-esc="data['examination_type']"/></td>\n                  </tr>\n                  <tr>\n                    <td><strong>Interpretasi</strong></td>\n                    <td colspan="3">Result PCR : <strong><t t-esc="data['result']"/></strong></td>\n                  </tr>\n                  <tr>\n                    <td><strong>Rekomendasi</strong></td>\n                    <td colspan="3"/>\n                  </tr>\n\n                </table>\n                <p class="mt-3 mb-0"><strong>Disclaimer</strong></p>\n                <p class="mb-0"><strong>Catatan:</strong></p>\n                <ul>\n                    <li>Hasil negatif tidak menyingkirkan kemungkinan infeksi SARS-CoV-2, sehingga masih beresiko menularkan kepada orang lain.</li>\n                    <li>Hasil negatif dapat terjadi pada kondisi kuantitas antigen pada specimen di bawah level deteksi alat.</li>\n                    <li>Jika hasil positif: Harus ada pemeriksaan konfirmasi dengan pemeriksaan RT PCR.</li> \n                </ul>\n                <br/>\n                <p class="mb-0"><strong>Note:</strong></p>\n                <ul>\n                    <li>Negative result does not rule out the possibility of SARS-CoV-2 infection, so it is still at risk of transmitting to others.</li>\n                    <li>Negative result can occur in antigen quality condition in specimen below the detection level of the device.</li>\n                    <li>If the result is positive: There must be a confirmatory check with RT PCR.</li>\n                </ul>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class="row pt-3">\n                <div class="col-7"/>\n                <div class="col-5">\n                    <p class="mb-0">Badung, <t t-esc="o.to_date_string(data['registration_date'])"/></p>\n                    <p class="mb-0">Dokter Pemeriksa / Physician Examiner</p>\n                    <img t-att-src="o['qr_code_url']" style="width:125px;height:125px;"/>\n                    <p class="mb-0 mt-2"><strong><t t-esc="data['practitioner']"/></strong></p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </t>\n      </t>\n    	ehealth_document/report/template_covid_report/report_dng_antigen.xml	\N	\N	\N	\N	primary	t	1	2025-08-28 11:34:01.364376	1	2025-08-28 11:34:01.364376	f
1494	report_esensia_pcr	\N	ehealth_document.report_esensia_pcr	16	qweb	<?xml version="1.0"?>\n<t t-name="ehealth_document.report_esensia_pcr">\n        <t t-set="company" t-value="res_company"/>\n        <t t-call="ehealth_document.header_esensia_document">\n          <div class="page">\n            <div class="row">\n              <div class="col-md-12">\n                <p class="text-center" style="font-size: 22px; margin-bottom: 0px;"><strong>HASIL PEMERIKSAAN LABORATORIUM</strong></p>\n                <p class="text-center" style="font-size: 18px; margin-top: 0px;"><strong>Laboratory Result</strong></p>\n                <div class="mt-3">\n                    <t t-if="data['sample_number']">\n                      <div class="row">\n                          <div class="col-4">No. Sample / Sample ID</div>\n                          <div class="col-3">: <t t-esc="data['sample_number']"/></div>\n                      </div>\n                    </t>\n                    <t t-if="(o['partner_id']['identity_number']) or (o['partner_id']['nik'])">\n                        <div class="row">\n                            <div class="col-4">\n                              <t t-if="o['partner_id']['identity_type'] == 'ktp'">NIK / ID Card</t>\n                              <t t-if="o['partner_id']['identity_type'] == 'sim'">No. SIM / Driver License</t>\n                              <t t-if="o['partner_id']['identity_type'] == 'paspor'">No. Paspor / Passport No.</t>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class="col-6">: \n                              <t t-if="o['partner_id']['identity_type'] == 'ktp'"><t t-esc="o['partner_id']['nik']"/></t>\n                              <t t-else=""><t t-esc="o['partner_id']['identity_number']"/></t>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </t>\n                    <div class="row">\n                        <div class="col-4">Nama / Name</div>\n                        <div class="col-6">: <t t-esc="o['partner_id']['name']"/></div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class="row">\n                        <div class="col-4">Tanggal Lahir / Date of Birth</div>\n                        <div class="col-6">: <t t-esc="o['partner_id']['birthDate'].strftime('%d-%m-%Y')"/></div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class="row">\n                        <div class="col-4">Jenis Kelamin / Gender</div>\n                        <div class="col-6">: \n                          <t t-if="o['partner_id']['gender'] == 'male'">Laki-Laki</t>\n                          <t t-else="">Perempuan</t>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class="row">\n                        <div class="col-4">Alamat / Address</div>\n                        <div class="col-6">: <t t-esc="o['partner_id']['street']"/></div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class="row">\n                        <div class="col-4">No. Telp / Phone Number</div>\n                        <div class="col-6">: <t t-esc="o['partner_id']['mobile']"/></div>\n                    </div>\n                    <t t-if="'appointment_date' in data and data['appointment_date']">\n                      <div class="row">\n                          <div class="col-4">Tanggal Sampling / Sampling Date</div>\n                          <div class="col-6">: <t t-esc="o.to_date_string(data['appointment_date'])"/> <t t-esc="o.to_time_string(data['appointment_date'])"/></div>\n                      </div>\n                    </t>\n                    <div class="row">\n                        <div class="col-4">Pengirim / Referred</div>\n                        <div class="col-6">: dr. Yanuar Ardani, M.Kes., Sp.PD</div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <table class="table table-bordered table-sm mt-3 mb-2">\n                  <tr class="text-center">\n                      <th>PEMERIKSAAN</th>\n                      <th>HASIL</th>\n                      <th>NILAI RUJUKAN</th>\n                      <th>SATUAN</th>\n                  </tr>\n                  <tr>\n                      <td colspan="4"><strong><t t-esc="data['examination_type']"/></strong></td>\n                  </tr>\n                  <t t-if="data['sample_note']">\n                    <tr>\n                        <td>Jenis Sampel / Sample Type</td>\n                        <td colspan="3">\n                          <t t-esc="data['sample_note']"/>\n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n                  </t>\n                  <tr>\n                      <td>SARS-CoV-2 ORF1ab</td>\n                      <td width="130" class="text-center">\n                        <t t-esc="data['orf1ab']"/>\n                      </td>\n                      <td class="text-center">\n                        <t t-if="'orf1ab_obs' in data and 'reference' in data['orf1ab_obs']">\n                          <t t-esc="data['orf1ab_obs']['reference']"/>\n                        </t>\n                      </td>\n                      <td class="text-center">\n                        <t t-if="'orf1ab_obs' in data and 'unit' in data['orf1ab_obs']">\n                          <t t-esc="data['orf1ab_obs']['unit']"/>\n                        </t>\n                      </td>\n                  </tr>\n                  <tr>\n                      <td>SARS-CoV-2 Gen N</td>\n                      <td width="130" class="text-center">\n                        <t t-esc="data['gen_n']"/>\n                      </td>\n                      <td class="text-center">\n                        <t t-if="'gen_n_obs' in data and 'reference' in data['gen_n_obs']">\n                          <t t-esc="data['gen_n_obs']['reference']"/>\n                        </t>\n                      </td>\n                      <td class="text-center">\n                        <t t-if="'gen_n_obs' in data and 'unit' in data['gen_n_obs']">\n                          <t t-esc="data['gen_n_obs']['unit']"/>\n                        </t>\n                      </td>\n                  </tr>\n                  <t t-if="data['gen_e']">\n                    <tr>\n                        <td>SARS-CoV-2 Gen E</td>\n                        <td width="130" class="text-center">\n                          <t t-esc="data['gen_e']"/>\n                        </td>\n                        <td class="text-center">\n                          <t t-if="'gen_e_obs' in data and 'reference' in data['gen_e_obs']">\n                            <t t-esc="data['gen_e_obs']['reference']"/>\n                          </t>\n                        </td>\n                        <td class="text-center">\n                          <t t-if="'gen_e_obs' in data and 'unit' in data['gen_e_obs']">\n                            <t t-esc="data['gen_e_obs']['unit']"/>\n                          </t>\n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n                  </t>\n                  <tr>\n                      <td>Interpretasi / Interpretation</td>\n                      <td width="130" class="text-center">\n                        <strong>\n                          <t t-if="data['result'] == 'Positive'">\n                            <span style="color:red">\n                               Positif\n                            </span>\n                          </t>\n                          <t t-if="data['result'] == 'Negative'">\n                            <span>\n                               Negatif\n                            </span>\n                          </t>\n                        </strong>\n                      </td>\n                      <td rowspan="2" class="text-center">Negatif</td>\n                      <td/>\n                  </tr>\n                </table>\n                <div class="pl-3 pr-3" style="font-size: 11px;">\n                  <p class="mt-3 mb-0">Catatan / Note:</p>\n                  <ol class="mt-0">\n                      <li>Hasil positif berlaku untuk hasil PCR SARS CoV-2 atau Antigen dari Laboratorium Klinik Utama Rawat Inap Esensia. Nilai tersebut tidak dapat dibandingkan dengan CT hasil PCR SARS CoV-2 atau Antigen dari laboratorium lain.<br/>Positive results apply to PCR results for SARS CoV-2 or Antigens from the Esensia Inpatient Main Clinical Laboratory. This value cannot be compared with CT PCR results from SARS CoV-2 or antigens from other laboratories.</li>\n                      <li>Kondisi tersebut hanya menggambarkan kondisi saat pengambilan sampel<br/>These conditions only describe the conditions at the time of sampling</li>\n                      <li>Bila hasil positif dan terdapat gejala klinis, segera konsultasikan ke faskes.<br/>If the results are positive and there are clinical symptoms, immediately consult a health facility</li>\n                      <li>Bila Hasil negatif tidak selalu berarti pasien tidak terinfeksi SARS CoV-2, dan perlu dilakukan pemeriksaan secara berkala.<br/>A negative result does not necessarily mean that the patient is not infected with SARS-CoV-2, and periodic examinations need to be carried out.</li>\n                  </ol>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class="row">\n                <div class="col-1"/>\n                <div class="col-3 py-3 mt-4">\n                    <div class="my-3" id="qrcode">\n                        <img t-att-src="o['qr_code_url']" style="width:125px;height:125px;"/>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class="col-4"/>\n                <div class="col-4 py-3">\n                    <p>Semarang, <t t-esc="o.to_date_string(data['registration_date'])"/></p>\n                    <div class="my-3" id="qrcode">\n                        <img t-att-src="data['signature']" style="width:125px;height:125px;"/>\n                    </div>\n                    <p><strong>dr. Anita Tri Hastuti, Sp.PK</strong></p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </t>\n      </t>\n    	ehealth_document/report/template_covid_report/report_esensia_pcr.xml	\N	\N	\N	\N	primary	t	1	2025-08-28 11:34:01.364376	1	2025-08-28 11:34:01.364376	f
