              <div class="row">\n                        <div class="col-4">Tanggal Lahir / Date of Birth</div>\n                        <div class="col-6">: <t t-esc="o['partner_id']['birthDate'].strftime('%d-%m-%Y')"/></div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class="row">\n                        <div class="col-4">Jenis Kelamin / Gender</div>\n                        <div class="col-6">: \n                          <t t-if="o['partner_id']['gender'] == 'male'">Laki-Laki</t>\n                          <t t-else="">Perempuan</t>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class="row">\n                        <div class="col-4">Alamat / Address</div>\n                        <div class="col-6">: <t t-esc="o['partner_id']['street']"/></div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class="row">\n                        <div class="col-4">No. Telp / Phone Number</div>\n                        <div class="col-6">: <t t-esc="o['partner_id']['mobile']"/></div>\n                    </div>\n                    <t t-if="'appointment_date' in data and data['appointment_date']">\n                      <div class="row">\n                          <div class="col-4">Tanggal Sampling / Sampling Date</div>\n                          <div class="col-6">: <t t-esc="o.to_date_string(data['appointment_date'])"/> <t t-esc="o.to_time_string(data['appointment_date'])"/></div>\n                      </div>\n                    </t>\n                    <div class="row">\n                        <div class="col-4">Tanggal Periksa / Check Date</div>\n                        <div class="col-6">: <t t-esc="o.to_date_string(data['registration_date'])"/> <t t-esc="o.to_time_string(data['registration_date'])"/></div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class="row">\n                        <div class="col-4">Pengirim / Referred</div>\n                        <div class="col-6">: dr. Yanuar Ardani, M.Kes., Sp.PD</div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <table class="table table-bordered table-sm mt-5 mb-2">\n                  <tr class="text-center">\n                      <th>PEMERIKSAAN</th>\n                      <th>HASIL</th>\n                      <th>NILAI RUJUKAN</th>\n                      <th>SATUAN</th>\n                  </tr>\n                  <tr>\n                      <td><t t-esc="data['examination_type']"/></td>\n                      <td rowspan="2" width="130" class="text-center">\n                        <strong>\n                          <t t-if="data['result'] == 'Positive'">\n                            <span style="color:red">\n                               Positif\n                            </span>\n                          </t>\n                          <t t-if="data['result'] == 'Negative'">\n                            <span>\n                               Negatif\n                            </span>\n                          </t>\n                        </strong>\n                      </td>\n                      <td rowspan="2" class="text-center">Negatif</td>\n                      <td/>\n                  </tr>\n                </table>\n                <div class="pl-3 pr-3" style="font-size: 11px;">\n                  <p class="mt-3">Catatan / Note:</p>\n                  <ol>\n                      <li>Hasil positif berlaku untuk hasil PCR SARS CoV-2 atau Antigen dari Laboratorium Klinik Utama Rawat Inap Esensia. Nilai tersebut tidak dapat dibandingkan dengan CT hasil PCR SARS CoV-2 atau Antigen dari laboratorium lain.<br/>Positive results apply to PCR results for SARS CoV-2 or Antigens from the Esensia Inpatient Main Clinical Laboratory. This value cannot be compared with CT PCR results from SARS CoV-2 or antigens from other laboratories.</li>\n                      <li>Kondisi tersebut hanya menggambarkan kondisi saat pengambilan sampel<br/>These conditions only describe the conditions at the time of sampling</li>\n                      <li>Bila hasil positif dan terdapat gejala klinis, segera konsultasikan ke faskes.<br/>If the results are positive and there are clinical symptoms, immediately consult a health facility</li>\n                      <li>Bila Hasil negatif tidak selalu berarti pasien tidak terinfeksi SARS CoV-2, dan perlu dilakukan pemeriksaan secara berkala.<br/>A negative result does not necessarily mean that the patient is not infected with SARS-CoV-2, and periodic examinations need to be carried out.</li>\n                  </ol>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class="row">\n                <div class="col-1"/>\n                <div class="col-3 py-3 mt-4">\n                    <div class="my-3" id="qrcode">\n                        <img t-att-src="o['qr_code_url']" style="width:125px;height:125px;"/>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class="col-4"/>\n                <div class="col-4 py-3">\n                    <p>Semarang, <t t-esc="o.to_date_string(data['registration_date'])"/></p>\n                    <div class="my-3" id="qrcode">\n                        <img t-att-src="data['signature']" style="width:125px;height:125px;"/>\n                    </div>\n                    <p><strong>dr. Anita Tri Hastuti, Sp.PK</strong></p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </t>\n      </t>\n    	ehealth_document/report/template_covid_report/report_esensia_antigen.xml	\N	\N	\N	\N	primary	t	1	2025-08-28 11:34:01.364376	1	2025-08-28 11:34:01.364376	f
1496	report_esensia_genose	\N	ehealth_document.report_esensia_genose	16	qweb	<?xml version="1.0"?>\n<t t-name="ehealth_document.report_esensia_genose">\n        <t t-set="company" t-value="res_company"/>\n        <t t-call="ehealth_document.header_esensia_document">\n          <div class="page">\n            <div class="row">\n              <div class="col-md-12">\n                <p class="text-center" style="font-size: 22px;"><strong>HASIL PEMERIKSAAN LABORATORIUM</strong></p>\n                <p class="text-center" style="font-size: 18px; margin-top: 0;"><strong>Laboratory Result</strong></p>\n                <div class="mt-3">\n                    <div class="row">\n                        <div class="col-4">No. Sample / Sample ID</div>\n                        <div class="col-3">: <t t-esc="o['name']"/></div>\n                    </div>\n                    <t t-if="(o['partner_id']['identity_number']) or (o['partner_id']['nik'])">\n                        <div class="row">\n                            <div class="col-4">\n                              <t t-if="o['partner_id']['identity_type'] == 'ktp'">NIK / ID Card</t>\n                              <t t-if="o['partner_id']['identity_type'] == 'sim'">No. SIM / Driver License</t>\n                              <t t-if="o['partner_id']['identity_type'] == 'paspor'">No. Paspor / Passport No.</t>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class="col-6">: \n                              <t t-if="o['partner_id']['identity_type'] == 'ktp'"><t t-esc="o['partner_id']['nik']"/></t>\n                              <t t-else=""><t t-esc="o['partner_id']['identity_number']"/></t>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </t>\n                    <div class="row">\n                        <div class="col-4">Nama / Name</div>\n                        <div class="col-6">: <t t-esc="o['partner_id']['name']"/></div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class="row">\n                        <div class="col-4">Tanggal Lahir / Date of Birth</div>\n                        <div class="col-6">: <t t-esc="o['partner_id']['birthDate'].strftime('%d-%m-%Y')"/></div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class="row">\n                        <div class="col-4">Jenis Kelamin / Gender</div>\n                        <div class="col-6">: \n                          <t t-if="o['partner_id']['gender'] == 'male'">Laki-Laki</t>\n                          <t t-else="">Perempuan</t>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class="row">\n                        <div class="col-4">Alamat / Address</div>\n                        <div class="col-6">: <t t-esc="o['partner_id']['street']"/></div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class="row">\n                        <div class="col-4">No. Telp / Phone Number</div>\n                        <div class="col-6">: <t t-esc="o['partner_id']['mobile']"/></div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class="row">\n                        <div class="col-4">Tanggal Periksa / Check Date</div>\n                        <div class="col-6">: <t t-esc="o.to_date_string(data['registration_date'])"/> <t t-esc="o.to_time_string(data['registration_date'])"/></div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class="row">\n                        <div class="col-4">Pengirim / Referred</div>\n                        <div class="col-6">: <t t-esc="o['partner_id']['street']"/></div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <table class="table table-bordered table-sm mt-5 mb-2">\n                  <tr class="text-center">\n                      <th>PEMERIKSAAN</th>\n                      <th>HASIL</th>\n                      <th>NILAI RUJUKAN</th>\n                      <th>SATUAN</th>\n                  </tr>\n                  <tr>\n                      <td><t t-esc="data['examination_type']"/></td>\n                      <td rowspan="2" width="130" class="text-center">\n                        <strong>\n                          <t t-if="data['result'] == 'Positive'">\n                            <span style="color:red">\n                               Positif\n                            </span>\n                          </t>\n                          <t t-if="data['result'] == 'Negative'">\n                            <span>\n                               Negatif\n                            </span>\n                          </t>\n                        </strong>\n                      </td>\n                      <td rowspan="2" class="text-center">Negatif</td>\n                      <td/>\n                  </tr>\n                </table>\n                <div class="pl-3 pr-3" style="font-size: 11px;">\n                  <p class="mt-3">Catatan / Note:</p>\n                  <ol>\n                      <li>Hasil positif berlaku untuk hasil PCR SARS CoV-2 atau Antigen dari Laboratorium Klinik Utama Rawat Inap Esensia. Nilai tersebut tidak dapat dibandingkan dengan CT hasil PCR SARS CoV-2 atau Antigen dari laboratorium lain.<br/>Positive results apply to PCR results for SARS CoV-2 or Antigens from the Esensia Inpatient Main Clinical Laboratory. This value cannot be compared with CT PCR results from SARS CoV-2 or antigens from other laboratories.</li>\n                      <li>Kondisi tersebut hanya menggambarkan kondisi saat pengambilan sampel<br/>These conditions only describe the conditions at the time of sampling</li>\n                      <li>Bila hasil positif dan terdapat gejala klinis, segera konsultasikan ke faskes.<br/>If the results are positive and there are clinical symptoms, immediately consult a health facility</li>\n                      <li>Bila Hasil negatif tidak selalu berarti pasien tidak terinfeksi SARS CoV-2, dan perlu dilakukan pemeriksaan secara berkala.<br/>A negative result does not necessarily mean that the patient is not infected with SARS-CoV-2, and periodic examinations need to be carried out.</li>\n                  </ol>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class="row pt-5">\n                <div class="col-1"/>\n                <div class="col-3 py-3 mt-4">\n                    <div class="my-3" id="qrcode">\n                        <img t-att-src="o['qr_code_url']" style="width:125px;height:125px;"/>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class="col-4"/>\n                <div class="col-4 py-3">\n                    <p>Semarang, <t t-esc="o.to_date_string(data['registration_date'])"/></p>\n                    <div class="my-3" id="qrcode">\n                        <img t-att-src="data['signature']" style="width:125px;height:125px;"/>\n                    </div>\n                    <p><strong>dr. Anita Tri Hastuti, Sp.PK</strong></p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </t>\n      </t>\n    	ehealth_document/report/template_covid_report/report_esensia_genose.xml	\N	\N	\N	\N	primary	t	1	2025-08-28 11:34:01.364376	1	2025-08-28 11:34:01.364376	f
1497	report_healthway_pcr	\N	ehealth_document.report_healthway_pcr	16	qweb	<?xml version="1.0"?>\n<t t-name="ehealth_document.report_healthway_pcr">\n        <t t-set="company" t-value="res_company"/>\n        <t t-call="ehealth_document.header_healthway_document">\n          <div class="page">\n            <div class="row">\n              <div class="col-md-12">\n                <div class="mt-3" style="font-size: 12px;">\n                    <div class="row mb-2">\n                        <div class="col-2"><strong>NO. REG. LAB</strong> <br/> <i>REG. LAB. NO.</i></div>\n                        <div class="col-4">: <t t-esc="o['name']"/></div>\n                        <div class="col-2"><strong>NO. REKAM MEDIS</strong> <br/> <i>MED. REC. NO.</i></div>\n                        <div class="col-4">: <t t-esc="o['partner_id']['medical_record']"/></div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class="row mb-2">\n                        <div class="col-2"><strong>NAMA LENGKAP</strong> <br/> <i>FULL NAME</i></div>\n                        <div class="col-4">: <t t-esc="o['partner_id']['name']"/></div>\n                        <t t-if="(o['partner_id']['identity_number']) or (o['partner_id']['nik'])">\n                          <div class="col-2">\n                            <t t-if="o['partner_id']['identity_type'] == 'ktp'"><strong>NIK</strong> <br/> <i>ID NO.</i></t>\n                            <t t-if="o['partner_id']['identity_type'] == 'sim'">No. SIM / Driver License</t>\n                            <t t-if="o['partner_id']['identity_type'] == 'paspor'">No. Paspor / Passport No.</t>\n                          </div>\n                          <div class="col-4">: \n                            <t t-if="o['partner_id']['identity_type'] == 'ktp'"><t t-esc="o['partner_id']['nik']"/></t>\n                            <t t-else=""><t t-esc="o['partner_id']['identity_number']"/></t>\n                          </div>\n                        </t>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class="row mb-2">\n                        <div class="col-2"><strong>TEMPAT, TANGGAL LAHIR</strong> <br/> <i>PLACE, BIRTH OF DATE</i></div>\n                        <div class="col-4">: <t t-if="o['partner_id']['birth_place']"><t t-esc="o['partner_id']['birth_place']"/>, </t><t t-esc="o['partner_id']['birthDate'].strftime('%d-%m-%Y')"/> / <t t-esc="o.count_age(o['partner_id']['birthDate'].strftime('%d/%m/%Y'))"/> Tahun</div>\n                        <div class="col-2"><strong>DOKTER</strong> <br/> <i>DOCTOR</i></div>\n                        <div class="col-4">: -</div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class="row mb-2">\n                        <div class="col-2"><strong>JENIS KELAMIN</strong> <br/> <i>SEX</i></div>\n                        <div class="col-4" style="text-transform: uppercase;">: \n                          <t t-if="o['partner_id']['gender'] == 'male'">Laki-Laki</t>\n                          <t t-else="">Perempuan</t>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class="col-2 pr-0"><strong>TANGGAL TRANSAKSI</strong> <br/> <i>TRANSACTION DATE</i></div>\n                        <div class="col-4">: <t t-esc="o.to_date_string(data['registration_date'])"/> <t t-esc="o.to_time_string(data['registration_date'])"/></div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class="row mb-2">\n                        <div class="col-2"><strong>ALAMAT</strong> <br/> <i>ADDRESS</i></div>\n                        <div class="col-4">: <t t-esc="o['partner_id']['street']"/></div>\n                        <div class="col-2"><strong>TANGGAL CETAK</strong> <br/> <i>PRINT DATE</i></div>\n                        <div class="col-4">: <t t-esc="o.date_now()"/> <t t-esc="o.time_now()"/></div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class="mt-4" style="font-size: 14px;">\n                    <div class="row mb-2">\n                        <div class="col-6"><strong>HASIL PEMERIKSAAN LABORATORIUM</strong> <br/> <i>LABORATORY RESULT</i></div>\n                        <div class="col-2" style="font-size: 12px;"><strong>Penanggungjawab</strong> <br/> <i>Doctor in Charge</i></div>\n                        <div class="col-4" style="font-size: 12px;">: dr. Fanny, Sp.PK</div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <table class="table table-bordered table-sm mt-3 mb-2" style="font-size: 12px;">\n                  <tr>\n                      <th><strong>PEMERIKSAAN</strong> <br/> <i>TEST NAME</i></th>\n                      <th><strong>HASIL</strong> <br/> <i>RESULT</i></th>\n                      <th><strong>NILAI RUJUKAN</strong> <br/> <i>REFERENCE</i></th>\n                      <th><strong>KETERANGAN</strong> <br/> <i>REMARK</i></th>\n                  </tr>\n                  <tr>\n                      <td colspan="4"><strong>BIOMOLEKULER</strong> <br/> <i>BIOMOLEKULER</i></td>\n                  </tr>\n                  <tr>\n                      <td class="pl-3"><strong>RT-PCR COVID19</strong> <br/> <i>RT-PCR COVID19</i></td>\n                      <td width="130">\n                        <t t-if="data['result'] == 'Positive'">\n                          <span style="color:red">\n                              <strong>Positif</strong> <br/> <i>Positive</i>\n                          </span>\n                        </t>\n                        <t t-if="data['result'] == 'Negative'">\n                          <span>\n                              <strong>Negatif</strong> <br/> <i>Negative</i>\n                          </span>\n                        </t>\n                      </td>\n                      <td>\n                        <strong>Negatif</strong> <br/> <i>Negative</i>\n                      </td>\n                      <td>\n                        <t t-if="'orf1ab_obs' in data and 'unit' in data['orf1ab_obs']">\n                          CT Value Gen ORF-1ab: <t t-esc="data['orf1ab_obs']['value']"/><br/>\n                        </t>\n                        <t t-if="'gen_n_obs' in data and 'reference' in data['gen_n_obs']">\n                          CT Value Gen N: <t t-esc="data['gen_n_obs']['value']"/><br/>\n                        </t>\n                        <t t-if="'gen_e_obs' in data and 'reference' in data['gen_e_obs']">\n                          CT Value Gen E: <t t-esc="data['gen_e_obs']['value']"/><br/>\n                        </t>\n                      </td>\n                  </tr>\n                </table>\n\n                <div class="row pt-1" style="font-size: 11px;">\n                    <div class="col-1"/>\n                    <div class="col-4"/>\n                    <div class="col-3 pt-3 mt-4">\n                        <div class="mt-3" id="qrcode">\n                            <img t-att-src="o['qr_code_url']" style="width:125px;height:125px;"/>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class="col-4 py-3">\n                        <p class="mt-0 mb-0 pt-0 pb-0">Tangerang Selatan, <t t-esc="o.to_date_string(data['registration_date'])"/></p>\n                        <p class="mt-1 mb-0 pt-0 pb-0"><strong>Divalidasi oleh,</strong></p>\n                        <p class="mt-0 mb-0 pt-0 pb-0"><i>Validated by,</i></p>\n                        <div class="mt-3" id="qrcode">\n                            <img t-att-src="data['signature']" style="width:115px;height:115px;"/>\n                        </div>\n                        <p><strong>dr. Fanny, Sp.PK</strong></p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class="pl-3 pr-3" style="font-size: 11px;">\n                  <p class="mt-0"><strong>Catatan :</strong> <br/> <i>Notes</i></p>\n                  <ol>\n                      <li><strong>PCR mendeteksi materi genetik virus tanpa membedakan virus hidup ataupun mati.</strong><br/>PCR detects viral genetic material (s) without distinguishing between live and dead viruses.</li>\n                      <li><strong>Hasil PCR tidak dapat dibandingkan antar alat dan gen yang berbeda.</strong><br/>PCR result cannot be compared across different instruments and genes.</li>\n                      <li><strong>Hasil PCR negatif tidak selalu berarti pasien tidak terinfeksi oleh patogen, namun hanya menunjukan bahwa material genetik patogen tidak ditemukan di dalam sampel.</strong><br/>A negative PCR result does not necessarily mean the patient is not infected by pathogen, but only shows that the pathogen genetic material was not found in the sample</li>\n                      <li><strong>Hasil PCR negatif tidak berarti pasien bebas dari COVID -19. Hasil negatif bisa disebabkan karena sedang dalam masa inkubasi. Bila ada gejala seperti demam, batuk, pilek, sakit tenggorokan, sakit kepala, sebaiknya lakukan pemeriksaan PCR kembali.</strong><br/>Negative PCR result doesn’t mean patient is safe from COVID-19. Negative result can happen due to incubation period. If there are any symptoms such as: fever, cough, flu, sore throat and/or headache, it is recommended to repeat the PCR test.</li>\n                      <li><strong>Penulisan tanggal transaksi sama dengan tanggal pengambilan sampel.</strong><br/>The writing of the transaction date is the same as the sampling date.</li>\n                  </ol>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </t>\n      </t>\n    	ehealth_document/report/template_covid_report/report_healthway_pcr.xml	\N	\N	\N	\N	primary	t	1	2025-08-28 11:34:01.364376	1	2025-08-28 11:34:01.364376	f
479	product.pricelist.item.search	product.pricelist.item	\N	16	search	<?xml version="1.0"?>\n<search string="Products Price Rules Search">\n                    <filter name="Product Rule" domain="[('applied_on', '=', '1_product')]"/>\n                    <filter name="Variant Rule" domain="[('applied_on', '=', '0_product_variant')]" groups="product.group_product_variant"/>\n                    <separator/>\n                    <field name="pricelist_id"/>\n                    <field name="company_id" groups="base.group_multi_company"/>\n                    <field name="currency_id" groups="base.group_multi_currency"/>\n                    <filter string="Archived" name="inactive" domain="[('active','=',False)]"/>\n                    <group expand="0" string="Group By">\n                        <filter string="Product" name="groupby_product" domain="[]" context="{'group_by': 'product_tmpl_id'}"/>\n                        <filter string="Variant" name="groupby_product_variant" domain="[('applied_on', '=', '0_product_variant')]" context="{'group_by': 'product_tmpl_id'}" groups="product.group_product_variant"/>\n                        <filter string="Pricelist" name="groupby_vendor" domain="[]" context="{'group_by': 'pricelist_id'}" groups="product.group_product_pricelist"/>\n                    </group>\n                </search>\n            	product/views/product_pricelist_views.xml	\N	\N	\N	\N	primary	t	1	2025-08-28 11:32:18.663929	1	2025-08-28 11:32:18.663929	\N
480	product.pricelist.item.tree	product.pricelist.item	\N	10	tree	<?xml version="1.0"?>\n<tree string="Price Rules">\n              <field name="pricelist_id"/>\n              <field name="name" string="Applied On"/>\n              <field name="price"/>\n              <field name="min_quantity" colspan="4"/>\n              <field name="date_start" optional="hide"/>\n              <field name="date_end" optional="hide"/>\n              <field name="company_id" groups="base.group_multi_company" optional="show"/>\n            </tree>\n          	product/views/product_pricelist_views.xml	\N	\N	\N	\N	primary	t	1	2025-08-28 11:32:18.663929	1	2025-08-28 11:32:18.663929	\N
1498	report_healthway_antigen	\N	ehealth_document.report_healthway_antigen	16	qweb	<?xml version="1.0"?>\n<t t-name="ehealth_document.report_healthway_antigen">\n        <t t-set="company" t-value="res_company"/>\n        <t t-call="ehealth_document.header_healthway_document">\n          <div class="page">\n            <div class="row">\n              <div class="col-md-12" style="font-size: 14px;">\n                <p class="text-center mb-0 mt-0" style="font-size: 22px;"><strong><u>SURAT KETERANGAN PEMERIKSAAN</u></strong></p>\n                <p class="text-center mb-0 mt-0" style="font-size: 18px; margin-top: 0;"><i>COVID-19 SCREENING TEST REFERENCE</i></p>\n                <p class="text-center mt-0"><strong><t t-esc="o['name']"/></strong></p>\n\n                <p><strong>Yang bertanda tangan di bawah ini, selaku Dokter Penanggung Jawab Laboratorium Klinik Healthway Indonesia menerangkan dengan sesungguhnya bahwa telah dilakukan pemeriksaan terhadap</strong></p>\n                <p><i>Here by the undersigned, explain that an antigen screening test has been carried out on:</i></p>\n\n\n                <div class="mt-3">\n                    <t t-if="(o['partner_id'].get_nik() != '')">\n                        <div class="row mb-1">\n                            <div class="col-4">\n                              <strong>NIK</strong> / ID Number\n                            </div>\n                            <div class="col-6">: \n                              <strong><t t-esc="o['partner_id'].get_nik()"/></strong>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </t>\n                    <t t-if="(o['partner_id'].get_passport() != '')">\n                        <div class="row mb-1">\n                            <div class="col-4">\n                              <strong>No. Paspor</strong> / Passport No.\n                            </div>\n                            <div class="col-6">: \n                              <strong><t t-esc="o['partner_id'].get_passport()"/></strong>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </t>\n                    <div class="row mb-1">\n                        <div class="col-4"><strong>Nama</strong> / <i>Name</i></div>\n                        <div class="col-6">: <strong><t t-esc="o['partner_id']['name']"/></strong></div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class="row mb-1">\n                        <div class="col-4"><strong>Tempat, Tanggal Lahir</strong> <br/> <i>Place, Date of Birth</i></div>\n                        <div class="col-3">: <strong><t t-if="o['partner_id']['birth_place']"><t t-esc="o['partner_id']['birth_place']"/>, </t><t t-esc="o['partner_id']['birthDate'].strftime('%d-%m-%Y')"/></strong></div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class="row mb-1">\n                        <div class="col-4"><strong>Jenis Kelamin</strong> / <i>Gender</i></div>\n                        <div class="col-6" style="text-transform: uppercase;">: \n                          <t t-if="o['partner_id']['gender'] == 'male'"><strong>Laki-Laki</strong> / <i>Male</i></t>\n                          <t t-else=""><strong>Perempuan</strong> / <i>Female</i></t>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class="row mb-1">\n                        <div class="col-4"><strong>Pekerjaan</strong> / <i>Occupation</i></div>\n                        <div class="col-6" style="text-transform: uppercase;">: <strong><t t-esc="o['partner_id']['function']"/></strong></div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class="row mb-1">\n                        <div class="col-4"><strong>Alamat</strong> / <i>Address</i></div>\n                        <div class="col-6">: <strong><t t-esc="o['partner_id']['street']"/></strong></div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class="row mb-1">\n                        <div class="col-4"><strong>Tanggal, Jam Pengambilan Sample </strong> <br/> <i>Date, Time Specimen Collection</i></div>\n                        <div class="col-6">: <strong><t t-esc="o.to_date_string(data['registration_date'])"/> <t t-esc="o.to_time_string(data['registration_date'])"/></strong></div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <table class="table table-bordered table-sm mt-3 mb-4">\n                  <tr class="text-center">\n                      <th style="font-weight: normal;"><strong>PEMERIKSAAN</strong><br/> <i>Screening</i></th>\n                      <th style="font-weight: normal;"><strong>HASIL</strong><br/> <i>Result</i></th>\n                      <th style="font-weight: normal;"><strong>NILAI RUJUKAN</strong><br/> <i>Reference</i></th>\n                  </tr>\n                  <tr>\n                      <td class="text-center">\n                        <strong>\n                          <t t-if="'service_name' in data">\n                            <t t-esc="data['service_name']"/><br/>\n                          </t>\n                          <t t-else="">Rapid Antigen Swab</t>\n                        </strong>\n                        <p class="mt-0 mb-0" style="color: white;">-</p>\n                      </td>\n                      <td rowspan="2" width="130" class="text-center">\n                        <t t-if="data['result'] == 'Positive'">\n                          <span style="color:red">\n                            <strong>Positif</strong><br/><i>Positive</i>\n                          </span>\n                        </t>\n                        <t t-if="data['result'] == 'Negative'">\n                          <span>\n                            <strong>Negatif</strong><br/><i>Negative</i>\n                          </span>\n                        </t>\n                      </td>\n                      <td rowspan="2" class="text-center"><strong>Negatif</strong><br/><i>Negative</i></td>\n                  </tr>\n                </table>\n\n                <p class="mb-1"><strong>Demikian surat keterangan ini dibuat sesuai dengan kondisi sebenarnya dan untuk dipergunakan sebagaimana mestinya. Hasil pemeriksaan Rapid Test Swab Antigen tidak dapat dipergunakan untuk menegakkan diagnosis COVID-19.</strong></p>\n                <p class="mb-1"><i>This test reference is made according to the actual conditions &amp; to be used properly. The result of the Rapid Antigen Swab test cannot be used to establish a diagnosis of COVID-19.</i></p>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class="row pt-2" style="font-size: 14px;">\n                <div class="col-4 py-2">\n                    <p class="mb-1"><strong>Tangerang Selatan, <t t-esc="o.to_date_string(data['registration_date'])"/></strong></p>\n                    <p class="mb-0"><strong>Divalidasi oleh,</strong></p>\n                    <p class="mb-0"><i>Validated by,</i></p>\n                    <div class="my-3" id="qrcode">\n                        <img t-att-src="data['signature']" style="width:115px;height:115px;"/>\n                    </div>\n                    <p class="mt-0 mb-0"><strong>dr. Fanny, Sp.PK</strong></p>\n                    <p class="mt-0 mb-0"><strong> </strong></p>\n                </div>\n                <div class="col-3 py-3 mt-4">\n                    <div class="my-3 pt-5" id="qrcode">\n                        <img t-att-src="o['qr_code_url']" style="width:115px;height:115px;"/>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class="col-1"/>\n                <div class="col-3"/>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </t>\n      </t>\n    	ehealth_document/report/template_covid_report/report_healthway_antigen.xml	\N	\N	\N	\N	primary	t	1	2025-08-28 11:34:01.364376	1	2025-08-28 11:34:01.364376	f
