1500	report_makara_antigen	\N	ehealth_document.report_makara_antigen	16	qweb	<?xml version="1.0"?>\n<t t-name="ehealth_document.report_makara_antigen">\n        <t t-set="company" t-value="res_company"/>\n        <t t-call="ehealth_document.header_makara_document">\n          <div class="page">\n            <div class="row">\n              <div class="col-md-12">\n                <p class="text-center" style="font-size: 22px; margin-bottom: 0px;"><strong>SURAT KETERANGAN</strong></p>\n                <p class="text-center" style="font-size: 18px; margin-top: 0px;"><strong>Nomor. <t t-esc="o['name']"/></strong></p>\n                <p>Saya yang bertandatangan di bawah ini, dr. Trevino Aristarkus Pakasi, M.S., Ph.D., Sp.KKLP dari Klinik Satelit UI Makara menerangkan bahwa :</p>\n                <div class="mt-3">\n                    <t t-if="(o['partner_id']['identity_number']) or (o['partner_id']['nik'])">\n                        <div class="row">\n                            <div class="col-4">\n                              <t t-if="o['partner_id']['identity_type'] == 'ktp'">NIK / ID Card</t>\n                              <t t-if="o['partner_id']['identity_type'] == 'sim'">No. SIM / Driver License</t>\n                              <t t-if="o['partner_id']['identity_type'] == 'paspor'">No. Paspor / Passport No.</t>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class="col-6">: \n                              <t t-if="o['partner_id']['identity_type'] == 'ktp'"><t t-esc="o['partner_id']['nik']"/></t>\n                              <t t-else=""><t t-esc="o['partner_id']['identity_number']"/></t>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </t>\n                    <div class="row">\n                        <div class="col-4">Nama / Name</div>\n                        <div class="col-6">: <strong><t t-esc="o['partner_id']['name']"/></strong></div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class="row">\n                        <div class="col-4">Tanggal Lahir / Date of Birth</div>\n                        <div class="col-6">: <t t-esc="o['partner_id']['birthDate'].strftime('%d-%m-%Y')"/></div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class="row">\n                        <div class="col-4">Alamat / Address</div>\n                        <div class="col-6">: <t t-esc="o['partner_id']['street']"/></div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <p class="mt-2">pada tanggal <t t-esc="o.to_date_string(data['registration_date'])"/> melakukan pemeriksaan Antigen dengan ringkasan sebagai berikut.</p>\n                <div class="row">\n                    <div class="col-4">Hasil Antigen</div>\n                    <div class="col-6">: \n                      <strong>\n                        <t t-if="data['result'] == 'Positive'">\n                          <span style="color:red">\n                              Positif\n                          </span>\n                        </t>\n                        <t t-if="data['result'] == 'Negative'">\n                          <span>\n                              Negatif\n                          </span>\n                        </t>\n                      </strong>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <t t-if="data['result'] == 'Negative'">\n                  <p class="mb-0">Saran: </p>\n                  <ul class="mt-0 pt-0">\n                    <li>Tetap menjalankan protokol kesehatan</li>\n                    <li>Test ulang</li>\n                    <li>Isolasi mandiri selama 10 hari</li>\n                    <li>Rujukan untuk ke RS</li>\n                  </ul>\n\n                  <p>Sebagai informasi, CT value yang dihasilkan dari pemeriksaan swab PCR  sangat bergantung dengan beberapa hal teknis pemeriksaan di masing-masing laboratorium. Berdasarkan hal ini, perlu kehati-hatian dalam menggunakan  CT value sebagai dasar penanganan pasien dan CT value tidak dianjurkan untuk menjadi dasar penanganan pasien COVID-19 saat ini.</p>\n                  <p>Sesuai dengan Pedoman Pencegahan dan Pengendalian COVID-19 Kemenkes RI Revisi ke-5, pasien COVID-19 tanpa gejala atau gejala ringan dinyatakan sembuh setelah selesai melaksanakan isolasi mandiri selama 10-14 hari dengan minimal 3 hari bebas gejala. Oleh karena itu  pemeriksaan PCR dan CT value sesudah isolasi mandiri tidak dibutuhkan lagi.</p>\n                  <p>Silahkan melakukan reservasi untuk konsultasi ke dokter dan memperoleh layanan tindak lanjut secara daring dari Klinik Satelit UI Makara melalui link pendaftaran <strong>reservasi.ehealth.co.id/kliniksatelitui</strong>.</p>\n                </t>\n                \n              </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class="row pt-3">\n              <div class="col-8 py-3">\n                  <p>Depok, <t t-esc="o.to_date_string(data['registration_date'])"/></p>\n                  <div class="my-3" id="qrcode">\n                      <img t-att-src="o['qr_code_url']" style="width:125px;height:125px;"/>\n                  </div>\n                  <p class="mb-0"><strong>dr. Trevino Aristarkus Pakasi, M.S., Ph.D., Sp.KKLP</strong></p>\n                  <p class="mt-0">Dokter Klinik Satelit UI Makara</p>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </t>\n      </t>\n    	ehealth_document/report/template_covid_report/report_makara_antigen.xml	\N	\N	\N	\N	primary	t	1	2025-08-28 11:34:01.364376	1	2025-08-28 11:34:01.364376	f
1501	report_usg_5d_pcr	\N	ehealth_document.report_usg_5d_pcr	16	qweb	<?xml version="1.0"?>\n<t t-name="ehealth_document.report_usg_5d_pcr">\n        <t t-set="company" t-value="res_company"/>\n        <t t-call="ehealth_document.header_usg_5d_document">\n          <div class="page">\n            <div class="row">\n              <div class="col-md-12">\n                <p class="text-center" style="font-size: 22px; margin-bottom: 0px;"><strong>HASIL PEMERIKSAAN LABORATORIUM</strong></p>\n                <p class="text-center" style="font-size: 18px; margin-top: 0px;"><strong>Laboratory Result</strong></p>\n                <div class="mt-3">\n                    <div class="row">\n                        <div class="col-4">No. Sample / Sample ID</div>\n                        <div class="col-3">: <t t-esc="o['name']"/></div>\n                    </div>\n                    <t t-if="(o['partner_id']['identity_number']) or (o['partner_id']['nik'])">\n                        <div class="row">\n                            <div class="col-4">\n                              <t t-if="o['partner_id']['identity_type'] == 'ktp'">NIK / ID Card</t>\n                              <t t-if="o['partner_id']['identity_type'] == 'sim'">No. SIM / Driver License</t>\n                              <t t-if="o['partner_id']['identity_type'] == 'paspor'">No. Paspor / Passport No.</t>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class="col-6">: \n                              <t t-if="o['partner_id']['identity_type'] == 'ktp'"><t t-esc="o['partner_id']['nik']"/></t>\n                              <t t-else=""><t t-esc="o['partner_id']['identity_number']"/></t>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </t>\n                    <div class="row">\n                        <div class="col-4">Nama / Name</div>\n                        <div class="col-6">: <t t-esc="o['partner_id']['name']"/></div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class="row">\n                        <div class="col-4">Tanggal Lahir / Date of Birth</div>\n                        <div class="col-6">: <t t-esc="o['partner_id']['birthDate'].strftime('%d-%m-%Y')"/></div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class="row">\n                        <div class="col-4">Jenis Kelamin / Gender</div>\n                        <div class="col-6">: \n                          <t t-if="o['partner_id']['gender'] == 'male'">Laki-Laki</t>\n                          <t t-else="">Perempuan</t>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class="row">\n                        <div class="col-4">Alamat / Address</div>\n                        <div class="col-6">: <t t-esc="o['partner_id']['street']"/></div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class="row">\n                        <div class="col-4">No. Telp / Phone Number</div>\n                        <div class="col-6">: <t t-esc="o['partner_id']['mobile']"/></div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class="row">\n                        <div class="col-4">Tanggal Periksa / Check Date</div>\n                        <div class="col-6">: <t t-esc="o.to_date_string(data['registration_date'])"/> <t t-esc="o.to_time_string(data['registration_date'])"/></div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class="row">\n                        <div class="col-4">Pengirim / Referred</div>\n                        <div class="col-6">: <t t-esc="o['partner_id']['street']"/></div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <table class="table table-bordered table-sm mt-3 mb-2">\n                  <tr class="text-center">\n                      <th>PEMERIKSAAN</th>\n                      <th>HASIL</th>\n                      <th>NILAI RUJUKAN</th>\n                      <th>SATUAN</th>\n                  </tr>\n                  <tr>\n                      <td colspan="4"><strong><t t-esc="data['examination_type']"/></strong></td>\n                  </tr>\n                  <tr>\n                      <td>SARS-CoV-2 ORF1ab</td>\n                      <td width="130" class="text-center">\n                        <t t-esc="data['orf1ab']"/>\n                      </td>\n                      <td class="text-center">\n                        <t t-if="'orf1ab_obs' in data and 'reference' in data['orf1ab_obs']">\n                          <t t-esc="data['orf1ab_obs']['reference']"/>\n                        </t>\n                      </td>\n                      <td class="text-center">\n                        <t t-if="'orf1ab_obs' in data and 'unit' in data['orf1ab_obs']">\n                          <t t-esc="data['orf1ab_obs']['unit']"/>\n                        </t>\n                      </td>\n                  </tr>\n                  <tr>\n                      <td>SARS-CoV-2 Gen N</td>\n                      <td width="130" class="text-center">\n                        <t t-esc="data['gen_n']"/>\n                      </td>\n                      <td class="text-center">\n                        <t t-if="'gen_n_obs' in data and 'reference' in data['gen_n_obs']">\n                          <t t-esc="data['gen_n_obs']['reference']"/>\n                        </t>\n                      </td>\n                      <td class="text-center">\n                        <t t-if="'gen_n_obs' in data and 'unit' in data['gen_n_obs']">\n                          <t t-esc="data['gen_n_obs']['unit']"/>\n                        </t>\n                      </td>\n                  </tr>\n                  <t t-if="data['gen_e']">\n                    <tr>\n                        <td>SARS-CoV-2 Gen E</td>\n                        <td width="130" class="text-center">\n                          <t t-esc="data['gen_e']"/>\n                        </td>\n                        <td class="text-center">\n                          <t t-if="'gen_e_obs' in data and 'reference' in data['gen_e_obs']">\n                            <t t-esc="data['gen_e_obs']['reference']"/>\n                          </t>\n                        </td>\n                        <td class="text-center">\n                          <t t-if="'gen_e_obs' in data and 'unit' in data['gen_e_obs']">\n                            <t t-esc="data['gen_e_obs']['unit']"/>\n                          </t>\n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n                  </t>\n                  <tr>\n                      <td>Interpretasi / Interpretation</td>\n                      <td width="130" class="text-center">\n                        <strong>\n                          <t t-if="data['result'] == 'Positive'">\n                            <span style="color:red">\n                               Positif\n                            </span>\n                          </t>\n                          <t t-if="data['result'] == 'Negative'">\n                            <span>\n                               Negatif\n                            </span>\n                          </t>\n                        </strong>\n                      </td>\n                      <td rowspan="2" class="text-center">Negatif</td>\n                      <td/>\n                  </tr>\n                </table>\n                <div class="pl-3 pr-3" style="font-size: 11px;">\n                  <p class="mt-3">Catatan / Note:</p>\n                  <ol>\n                      <li>Hasil positif berlaku untuk hasil PCR SARS CoV-2 atau Antigen dari Laboratorium Klinik Utama Rawat Inap Esensia. Nilai tersebut tidak dapat dibandingkan dengan CT hasil PCR SARS CoV-2 atau Antigen dari laboratorium lain.<br/>Positive results apply to PCR results for SARS CoV-2 or Antigens from the Esensia Inpatient Main Clinical Laboratory. This value cannot be compared with CT PCR results from SARS CoV-2 or antigens from other laboratories.</li>\n                      <li>Kondisi tersebut hanya menggambarkan kondisi saat pengambilan sampel<br/>These conditions only describe the conditions at the time of sampling</li>\n                      <li>Bila hasil positif dan terdapat gejala klinis, segera konsultasikan ke faskes.<br/>If the results are positive and there are clinical symptoms, immediately consult a health facility</li>\n                      <li>Bila Hasil negatif tidak selalu berarti pasien tidak terinfeksi SARS CoV-2, dan perlu dilakukan pemeriksaan secara berkala.<br/>A negative result does not necessarily mean that the patient is not infected with SARS-CoV-2, and periodic examinations need to be carried out.</li>\n                  </ol>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class="row pt-3">\n                <div class="col-1"/>\n                <div class="col-3 py-3 mt-4">\n                    <div class="my-3" id="qrcode">\n                        <img t-att-src="o['qr_code_url']" style="width:125px;height:125px;"/>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class="col-4"/>\n                <div class="col-4 py-3">\n                    <p>Semarang, <t t-esc="o.to_date_string(data['registration_date'])"/></p>\n                    <div class="my-3" id="qrcode">\n                        <img t-att-src="data['signature']" style="width:125px;height:125px;"/>\n                    </div>\n                    <p><strong>dr. Anita Tri Hastuti, Sp.PK</strong></p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </t>\n      </t>\n    	ehealth_document/report/template_covid_report/report_usg_5d_pcr.xml	\N	\N	\N	\N	primary	t	1	2025-08-28 11:34:01.364376	1	2025-08-28 11:34:01.364376	f
